      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-20T14:13:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point, I\u0027m adding code to protect the sequence calling AMediaFormat_toString and making a copy into a CString (rather than CStr) with a mutex. It\u0027s still not perfectly safe since I cannot guarantee that there are no other callers of this API in the process, but it\u0027s a debug API, so I\u0027m not too worried about it. Terrible NDK API design though.",
      "parentUuid": "f4d7abcc_9bc249a0",
