      "message": "Not sure I understand, the codec owns input and output buffers, so tying the lifetime of the returned \u0026[u8] pointers to \u0026self is exactly what I want. \"release_output_buffer\"\u0027s full name should be \"release_output_buffer_back_to_codec_after_you_are_done_with_it_so_that_it_can_be_filled_with_another_frame\", it\u0027s not implying that the underlying memory is freed.",
